  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Three equipotential surfaces are shown around a negative point charge. The potential difference between two consecutive equipotential surfaces is 30 V.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the direction of the electric field and what is the total work done when a positive charge 2 mC is moved from A to B and then to C?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Direction of the electric field</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Total work done when moving a positive charge from A to B and then to C</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Away from the negative charge</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Away from the negative charge</td>\n<td>240 mJ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Towards the negative charge</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Towards the negative charge</td>\n<td>240 mJ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
